  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "Given equation: 11 × 2 + 15 ÷ 13 - 3 = 14.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 14 and 15\n\nGiven: 11 × 2 + 15 ÷ 13 - 3 = 14\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 11 × 2 + __**14 ÷ 13**__ - 3 = 15\n\n⇒ __**11 × 2**__ + 1.07 - 3 = 15\n\n⇒ __**22 + 1.07**__ - 3 = 15\n\n⇒ __23.07 - 3__ = 15\n\n⇒ 20.07 ≠ 15\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) 3 and 2\n\nGiven: 11 × 2 + 15 ÷ 13 - 3 = 14\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 11 × 3 + __**15 ÷ 13**__ - 2 = 14\n\n⇒ __**11 × 3**__ + 1.15 - 2 = 14\n\n⇒ __**3**____**3 + 1.15**__ - 2 = 14\n\n⇒ __34.15 -____ 2__ = 14\n\n⇒ 32.15 ≠ 14\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 13 and 3\n\nGiven: 11 × 2 + 15 ÷ 13 - 3 = 14\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 11 × 2 + __**15 ÷ 3**__ - 13 = 14\n\n⇒ __**11 × 2**__ + 5 - 13 = 14\n\n⇒ __**2**____**2 + 5**__ - 13 = 14\n\n⇒ __27 - 13__ = 14\n\n⇒ 14 = 14\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 4) 11 and 15\n\nGiven: 11 × 2 + 15 ÷ 13 - 3 = 14\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 15 × 2 + __**11 ÷ 13**__ - 3 = 14\n\n⇒ __**15 × 2**__ + 0.84 - 3 = 14\n\n⇒ __**30**____** + 0.84**__ - 3 = 14\n\n⇒ __30.84 - 3__ = 14\n\n⇒ 27.84 ≠ 14\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
